OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK win by-election after
OL,4,Acouncillor resigns
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has won a council by-election
OL,7,Fin Sheffield by 297 votes.
OL,9,FThe party's Paul Jakeman won with 1,133
OL,10,Fvotes to Labour candidate Jayne Dunn's
OL,11,F836 at the Southey ward by-election on
OL,12,FThursday, which took place after the
OL,13,Fresignation of independent councillor
OL,14,FGareth Slater in July.
OL,16,FIn a statement issued on Friday,
OL,17,FJakeman said: "This was a victory for
OL,18,FReform's commonsense policies on
OL,19,Fhousing, public transport, the state of
OL,20,FSheffield's roads and how the council
OL,21,Fis managed."
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
