OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK win by-election after
OL,4,Acouncillor resigns
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after the results were
OL,7,Fannounced, council and Labour leader
OL,8,FFran Belbin said she was pleased that
OL,9,Fher party was closing the gap on Reform
OL,10,Fin the ward and had "good hopes for the
OL,11,Ffuture".
